<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Portofolio - Shofa Felensia | Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS for modern responsive design -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- FontAwesome for icons -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <!-- Google Fonts Inter -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        softPink: {
                            50: '#fdf2f4',
                            100: '#fbe8ec',
                            200: '#f7d3db',
                            300: '#f1abbc',
                            400: '#e87591',
                            500: '#dc4c70',
                        },
                        skyBlue: {
                            50: '#f0f9ff',
                            100: '#e0f2fe',
                            200: '#bae6fd',
                            300: '#7dd3fc',
                            400: '#38bdf8',
                            500: '#0ea5e9',
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            touch-action: manipulation;
        }
        .hero-glow {
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(224,242,254,0.8) 0%, rgba(253,242,244,0.5) 100%);
        }
        .card-hover {
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
        }
        .card-hover:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(220, 76, 112, 0.15), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 via-pink-50/40 to-sky-50 text-slate-700 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between selection:bg-softPink-400 selection:text-white">

    <header class="w-full bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-pink-100 sticky top-0 z-50">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-softPink-400 to-skyBlue-400 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shadow-md shadow-pink-200">
                    SF
                </div>
                <div>
                    <span class="font-bold text-base text-slate-800 tracking-tight block leading-tight">Shofa Felensia</span>
                    <span class="text-xs text-softPink-500 font-medium">SMK Farmasi Cendikia Farma Husada</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <nav class="hidden sm:flex items-center space-x-6 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-600">
                <a href="#about" class="hover:text-softPink-500 transition">Tentang</a>
                <a href="#skills" class="hover:text-softPink-500 transition">Keahlian</a>
                <a href="#projects" class="hover:text-softPink-500 transition">Projek</a>
                <a href="#contact" class="px-4 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-softPink-400 to-skyBlue-400 text-white rounded-xl shadow-md hover:opacity-90 transition">Kontak</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 flex-1 py-12 sm:py-20 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center hero-glow p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-pink-100 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Decorative background blobs -->
            <div class="absolute -top-24 -right-24 w-72 h-72 bg-skyBlue-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-2xl opacity-60"></div>
            <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -left-24 w-72 h-72 bg-softPink-200 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-2xl opacity-60"></div>

            <div class="md:col-span-7 space-y-6 relative z-10 text-center md:text-left">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/80 border border-pink-200 text-xs font-bold text-softPink-500 shadow-sm">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i><span>Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 tracking-tight leading-tight">
                    Halo, Saya <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-softPink-500 to-skyBlue-500">Shofa Felensia</span> 👋
                </h1>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
                    Siswa SMK Farmasi Cendikia Farma Husada dengan minat mendalam di bidang pengembangan web dan pembuatan game interaktif. Menggabungkan ketelitian bidang kesehatan dan logika pemrograman perangkat lunak.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center md:justify-start">
                    <a href="#projects" class="px-6 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-softPink-400 to-skyBlue-400 text-white font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-lg shadow-pink-200 hover:opacity-95 transition text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-code"></i> Lihat Projek Saya
                    </a>
                    <a href="#about" class="px-6 py-3.5 bg-white text-slate-700 border border-pink-200 font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:bg-pink-50/50 transition text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-user-pen text-softPink-400"></i> Profil Singkat
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Profile Avatar Card with User Photo -->
            <div class="md:col-span-5 flex justify-center relative z-10">
                <div class="w-64 h-64 sm:w-72 sm:h-72 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-softPink-300 via-pink-200 to-skyBlue-300 p-1.5 shadow-2xl transform rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 transition duration-300">
                    <div class="w-full h-full bg-white rounded-[22px] flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4 text-center space-y-2 overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="w-32 h-32 sm:w-36 sm:h-36 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md border-2 border-pink-200">
                            <img src="https://webschool.id/siswa/uploads/siswa_1788921353_2622844f.jpeg" alt="Shofa Felensia" class="w-full h-full object-cover" onerror="this.onerror=null;this.src='https://placehold.co/150x150/fdf2f4/dc4c70?text=SF';">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-800 leading-tight">Shofa Felensia</h3>
                            <span class="text-xs bg-skyBlue-100 text-skyBlue-600 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold mt-1 inline-block">Web Developer</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="about" class="mt-20 space-y-12">
            <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-2">
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800">Tentang & Keahlian</h2>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">Kombinasi unik antara ilmu kesehatan dan keahlian rekayasa perangkat lunak.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- About Card -->
                <div class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur border border-pink-100 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg space-y-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-pink-100 text-softPink-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-school"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800">Latar Belakang Pendidikan</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                        Saat ini saya menempuh pendidikan di <strong class="text-slate-800">SMK Farmasi Cendikia Farma Husada</strong> mengambil jurusan <strong class="text-softPink-500">Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak (RPL)</strong>. Latar belakang ini memotivasi saya untuk menciptakan aplikasi edukasi kesehatan dan game interaktif yang bermanfaat bagi dunia sekolah dan masyarakat.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Skills Card (HTML & Laravel) -->
                <div id="skills" class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur border border-pink-100 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-lg space-y-4">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-skyBlue-100 text-skyBlue-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800">Keahlian Teknis (Skills)</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Teknologi dan bahasa pemrograman yang dikuasai:</p>
                    
                    <div class="space-y-3 pt-2">
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">
                                <span>HTML & Web Frontend</span>
                                <span class="text-softPink-500">90%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full bg-pink-100 h-2.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-softPink-400 to-pink-500 h-full w-[90%] rounded-full"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">
                                <span>Laravel Framework</span>
                                <span class="text-skyBlue-500">85%</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="w-full bg-sky-100 h-2.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                                <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-skyBlue-400 to-skyBlue-500 h-full w-[85%] rounded-full"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="projects" class="mt-20 space-y-8">
            <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto space-y-2">
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800">Projek Unggulan</h2>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">Beberapa game interaktif dan aplikasi web yang telah saya kembangkan.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <!-- Project 1 -->
                <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border border-pink-100 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-lg card-hover flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-pink-100 text-softPink-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800 mb-2">1. Game Interaktif</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            Projek web game interaktif dengan navigasi responsif dan animasi yang menarik untuk pengalaman pengguna yang menyenangkan.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <a href="https://shofafelensia8-byte.github.io/landingpage_shofa/" target="_blank" class="w-full py-3 bg-pink-50 hover:bg-softPink-400 hover:text-white text-softPink-500 font-bold text-xs rounded-xl border border-pink-200 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i> Kunjungi Projek 1
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Project 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border border-sky-100 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-lg card-hover flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-sky-100 text-skyBlue-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-kit-medical"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800 mb-2">2. Game BSMR Aksi Siaga</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            Simulasi tanggap darurat sekolah bertema ekstrakurikuler PMR dan BSMR dengan tantangan triage medis dan evakuasi tandu.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <a href="https://shofafelensia8-byte.github.io/landingpage_bsmr/" target="_blank" class="w-full py-3 bg-sky-50 hover:bg-skyBlue-400 hover:text-white text-skyBlue-600 font-bold text-xs rounded-xl border border-sky-200 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i> Kunjungi Projek 2
                    </a>
                </div>

                <!-- Project 3 -->
                <div class="bg-white/90 backdrop-blur border border-pink-100 rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-lg card-hover flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-pink-100 text-softPink-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl font-bold mb-4">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-capsules"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-slate-800 mb-2">3. Game BSMR Teka Teki P3K</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                            Game edukasi teka-teki obat ringan dan peralatan P3K di sekolah dengan pertanyaan ringan dan penjelasan edukatif yang mudah.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <a href="https://shofafelensia8-byte.github.io/landingpage_bmr2/" target="_blank" class="w-full py-3 bg-pink-50 hover:bg-softPink-400 hover:text-white text-softPink-500 font-bold text-xs rounded-xl border border-pink-200 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square"></i> Kunjungi Projek 3
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contact" class="mt-20 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur border border-pink-100 p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-xl text-center space-y-6">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-tr from-softPink-400 to-skyBlue-400 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto text-2xl shadow-md">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800">Mari Terhubung!</h2>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed">
                Tertarik berkolaborasi dalam proyek web development, game edukasi, atau diskusi seputar RPL dan kesehatan sekolah? Hubungi saya kapan saja!
            </p>
            <div class="flex justify-center gap-4">
                <a href="mailto:shofa@example.com" class="px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-softPink-400 to-skyBlue-400 text-white font-bold rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:opacity-95 transition text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Kirim Email
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="w-full py-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-500 border-t border-pink-100 mt-20 bg-white/50">
        <p>© 2026 Shofa Felensia • Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak • SMK Farmasi Cendikia Farma Husada</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
